@@ -0,0 +1,574 @@
+/* vax820_klesib.c: KLESI-B VAXBI tape adapter (TB), adapter part
+
+   Incorporates the DWBUA model of vax820_uba.c, Copyright (c) 2019,
+   Matt Burke, and code from SimH, Copyright (c) 2004-2008, Robert M Supnik
